# SECOND LINE OF DEFENCE, NOT THE FIX. A file named "AI API Key created successfully.txt"
# appeared at this root; the fix was moving it out of the repo entirely (secrets live under
# C:\Aroma\secrets, never here). This rule only stops the NEXT one being staged by accident.
# Root only — a .txt inside src/ or docs/ is ordinary project content and stays visible.
# It covers nothing already tracked, so it is protection against a future mistake, not a
# cleanup of a past one.
/*.txt
